window.MNM_WT.route["1-5|faelindral"]="<div class=\"sc-wrap\"><p class=\"sc-pick\"><span class=\"badge unc\">unverified</span> No start city picked: choose one in the <b>Start</b> box in the top bar to see its route for levels 1–5.</p><div class=\"sc-route\" data-sc=\"faelindral\"><h3 class=\"sc-h\">Start-city route: Faelindral · levels 1–5 <span class=\"badge fact\">sourced route</span></h3><h4 class=\"sc-bh\">Levels 1–5: Class starter, newbie yard below the Traveler&#x27;s Lift</h4><ul class=\"sc-steps-list\"><li class=\"sc-step sc-fc\" data-scc=\"archer\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Archer only</span> <span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Class starter quest: <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a href=\"/quest-helper.html\">Wiki quest walkthroughs (quest helper)</a></span><details class=\"sc-q\" id=\"scq-faelindral-s-archer\"><summary><b>Archer Starter Quest (Faelindral)</b> <span class=\"sc-tag sc-rec\">Recommended</span> <span class=\"dim\">lvl 1</span></summary><p class=\"sc-why\"><span class=\"badge strat\">strategy</span> Novice Scout Bracer at 1, Weald Scout Bracer at 4, then a level 8 elemental-samples step and Scout&#x27;s Longbow of the Wyrdguard at 15+. Wyrdguard + and Fellstone Orcs − at every step.</p><table class=\"kv sc-kv\"><tr><th>Giver</th><td>Captain Keyaryn Thornshade (the infobox says Commander Elydris Stormbough; see the trainer note)</td></tr><tr><th>Where</th><td>Faelindral · Captain Keyaryn Thornshade, Sentinel&#x27;s Terrace (see the trainer note on the giver conflict)</td></tr><tr><th>Level</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Classes</th><td>Archer</td></tr><tr><th>Needs first</th><td>none listed</td></tr><tr><th>Faction</th><td>Wyrdguard (+); Fellstone Orcs (-)</td></tr><tr><th>Turn in</th><td>see the steps below (wiki walkthrough)</td></tr><tr><th>Rewards</th><td>(exp); Novice Scout Bracer; Weald Scout Bracer; Scout&#x27;s Longbow of the Wyrdguard</td></tr></table><h5>Mobs and items</h5><ul class=\"tight\"><li><b>Unintelligible Writings x6 (part 2)</b>: Fellstone scouts (3-6)</li><li><b>Rune-Etched Bone x4 (part 3, level 4)</b>: old elven skeletons</li><li><b>Docile Faefly (part 3, level 8)</b>: an annoyed faefly (8): /take sample by the Calafreyan ruins spire after 6pm game time; avoid 3-6am, when a twisted fae patrols</li><li><b>Necrotic Ash, Letter of Correspondence, Dark Hood (part 4, 15+)</b>: Calafreyan humanoids with the Blessing of the Forest Spirits buff, and a dark-robed figure</li></ul><ol class=\"tight sc-steps\"><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 1 - Req. Lvl 1 - Scout Courier</b></li><li>Read the Rolled Leafscroll you start with as a new Archer character:</li><li>Head to Sentinels Terrace, which resides above the Traders Terrace in Faelindral.</li><li>Take the Traveler&#x27;s Lift (where you entered the game). (You can double click on the bell and the lift will come. Double click the bell again to send the lift up.)</li><li>Go the the inn, then up, then right (in a right angle). When you see Pine Brightreed go left. (You are now at Traders Terrace)</li><li>Go toward the weapons armor sign and take the ramp at the left of Taelin Goldstem.</li><li>Take the bridge on your left, go left again and Captain Keyaryn Thornshade will be at the center of the giant trunk.</li><li>Give Rolled Leafscroll to Captain Keyaryn Thornshade.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Wyrdguard (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Fellstone Orcs (-)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Reconnaissance Satchel.</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Briefing for Scout Faeweald from Captain Keyaryn Thornshade.</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Briefing for Scout Gladebow from Captain Keyaryn Thornshade.</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Briefing for Scout Stonebranch from Captain Keyaryn Thornshade.</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Briefing for Scout Amber Ward from Captain Keyaryn Thornshade.</li><li>Start by heading to Scout Gladebow, who can be found on the platform east of Sentinel&#x27;s Terrace.</li><li>Give Briefing for Scout Gladebow to Scout Gladebow.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Wyrdguard (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Fellstone Orcs (-)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Gladebow&#x27;s Report from Scout Gladebow.</li><li>Next, head to Scout Amberward, who can be found at the base of the Keeper&#x27;s Lift in Evershade Weald.</li><li>At the bottom of the Keeper&#x27;s Lift, turn left and run through the ruins. Before crossing the bridge, turn right and you will see Scout Amberward overlooking a fallen log.</li><li>Give Briefing for Scout Amberward to Scout Amberward.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Wyrdguard (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Fellstone Orcs (-)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Amberward&#x27;s Report from Scout Amberward.</li><li>Next, locate Scout Faeweald, who is located near the base of the Pixie Lift (Druid&#x27;s Circle). Descend the lift and walk straight off the ramp towards the tree.</li><li>Give Briefing for Scout Faeweald to Scout Faeweald.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Wyrdguard (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Fellstone Orcs (-)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Faeweald&#x27;s Report from Scout Faeweald.</li><li>Lastly, find Scout Stonebranch, who is located near the base of the Traveler&#x27;s Lift (Newbie Lift).</li><li>As you exit the Traveler&#x27;s Lift, turn right and you will spot Scout Stonebranch near a bush.</li><li>Give Briefing for Scout Stonebranch to Scout Stonebranch.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Wyrdguard (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Fellstone Orcs (-)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Stonebranch&#x27;s Report from Scout Stonebranch.</li><li>Place Gladebow&#x27;s Report, Amberward&#x27;s Report, Faeweald&#x27;s Report, Stonebranch&#x27;s Report into the Reconnaissance Satchel and click Combine.</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You craft Full Reconnaissance Satchel.</li><li>Return to Captain Keyaryn Thornshade and hand them the Full Reconnaissance Satchel.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Wyrdguard (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Fellstone Orcs (-)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Novice Scout Bracer from Captain Keyaryn Thornshade.</li><li class=\"dim\">Note: Completing this stage of the quest will provide five yellow bars of XP at level 1.</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 2 - Req. Lvl 1 - Orc Intelligence Gathering</b></li><li>Return to Scout Amberward, who can be found at the base of the Keeper&#x27;s Lift in Evershade Weald.</li><li>At the bottom of the Keeper&#x27;s Lift, turn left and run through the ruins. Before crossing the bridge, turn right and you will see Scout Amberward overlooking a fallen log.</li><li>Give Novice Scout Bracer to Scout Amberward.</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Scout&#x27;s Satchel from Scout Amberward.</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive your items back from Scout Amberward.</li><li>Hunt a Fellstone scout in Evershade Weald until you find loot 6 x Unintelligible Writings.</li><li>Place the 6 x Unintelligible Writings into the Scout&#x27;s Satchel in stacks of 1 (one item per slot). Click Combine.</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You craft Full Scout Satchel.</li><li>Return to Scout Amberward and hand him the Full Scout Satchel.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Wyrdguard (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Fellstone Orcs (-)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Full Scout Satchel from Scout Amberward.</li><li>Return to Captain Keyaryn Thornshade and hand them the Full Scout Satchel.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Wyrdguard (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Fellstone Orcs (-)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Full Scout Satchel from Captain Keyaryn Thornshade.</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 3 - Req. Lvl 4 - Translating Orcish</b></li><li>Locate Researcher Fairgrove, who is located in the Heartwood Archives above the bank in Faelindral.</li><li>Give Full Scout Satchel to Researcher Fairgrove.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Wyrdguard (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Fellstone Orcs (-)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Sheaf of Circled Symbols from Researcher Fairgrove.</li><li>Review the Sheaf of Circled Symbols item description, which will note &quot;A page of seemingly illegible symbols, two of which have been circled.</li><li class=\"dim\">Note: There are no mud command responses when searching for a Wyrding tome, and Telaldrin the Wanderer does not respond to prompts about it.</li><li>Go past the Archer guild to the Pixie lift and take it down. Go left past the circle of glowing mushrooms to the tree near the ramp up. Stand next to the tree.</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Handful of Ivy.</li></ol><p><span class=\"badge unc\">unverified</span> The wiki marks this quest page as needing more info; missing steps: no sourced data yet.</p><p><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Part 1 is a courier run to four scouts (Gladebow, Amberward at the foot of the Keeper&#x27;s Lift, Faeweald by the Pixie Lift, Stonebranch by the Traveler&#x27;s Lift); the wiki says it is worth five yellow bars of XP at level 1. <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Archer_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">Wiki: Archer Starter Quest (Faelindral) (rev 75499)</a></span></p><p class=\"sc-ql\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Archer_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">wiki</a> · <a href=\"/quest-helper.html#q-archer-starter-quest-faelindral\">quest helper</a> · wiki walkthrough updated 2026-10-03</p></details></li><li class=\"sc-step sc-fc\" data-scc=\"bard\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Bard only</span> <span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Class starter quest: <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a href=\"/quest-helper.html\">Wiki quest walkthroughs (quest helper)</a></span><details class=\"sc-q\" id=\"scq-faelindral-s-bard\"><summary><b>Bard Starter Quest (Faelindral)</b> <span class=\"sc-tag sc-rec\">Recommended</span> <span class=\"dim\">lvl 1</span></summary><p class=\"sc-why\"><span class=\"badge strat\">strategy</span> Ring of Introduction at 1, the Lambent Lute at 4 and the Lute of the Charmed at 8.</p><table class=\"kv sc-kv\"><tr><th>Giver</th><td>Pine Brightreed</td></tr><tr><th>Where</th><td>Faelindral · Pine Brightreed (read the Perfumed Letter you start with); later steps with Laenyth Windharp and Sylphrena Starfall in the Lambent Lantern</td></tr><tr><th>Level</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Classes</th><td>Bard</td></tr><tr><th>Needs first</th><td>none listed</td></tr><tr><th>Faction</th><td>no sourced data yet</td></tr><tr><th>Turn in</th><td>see the steps below (wiki walkthrough)</td></tr><tr><th>Rewards</th><td>Ring of Introduction (part 1), Lambent Lute (part 2), Lute of the Charmed (part 3)</td></tr></table><h5>Mobs and items</h5><ul class=\"tight\"><li><b>Pixie Glitter (part 2 ingredients)</b>: Six Eyes Too Many (6 Widow Eyes from black and elder widows)</li><li><b>Bundle of Strong Silk (part 3e)</b>: a deadwood matriarch (16), the Keeper&#x27;s Bight spider log</li></ul><ol class=\"tight sc-steps\"><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 1a (Delivery)</b></li><li>Sylvosa Pineweld is in the smelting area.</li><li>Wyrdguard Mithrilvine is right at the bottom of the Keeper&#x27;s Lift.</li><li>Listener Maplebloom is at the campfire at the Balanced Branch.</li><li>Sersil Tangleroot is across from the lift.</li><li>Lorinthal Skybranch is in the tree trunk on the platform south of the Traveler&#x27;s lift, behind the trader&#x27;s area.</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 1b (Performance)</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 1c (Finish)</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 2a (Gather)</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 2b (Trickster)</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 2d (Finish)</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 3b (Potion)</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li></ol><p><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Part 3 also involves Mistress Naelira, the naiad behind the waterfall deep in a cave. <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Bard_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">Wiki: Bard Starter Quest (Faelindral) (rev 80008)</a>, <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Evershade_Weald\">Wiki: Evershade Weald (rev 83151, 2026-10-18)</a></span></p><p class=\"sc-ql\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Bard_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">wiki</a> · <a href=\"/quest-helper.html#q-bard-starter-quest-faelindral\">quest helper</a> · wiki walkthrough updated 2026-10-11</p></details></li><li class=\"sc-step sc-fc\" data-scc=\"beastmaster\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Beastmaster only</span> <span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Class starter quest: <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a href=\"/quest-helper.html\">Wiki quest walkthroughs (quest helper)</a></span><details class=\"sc-q\" id=\"scq-faelindral-s-beastmaster\"><summary><b>Beastmaster Starter Quest (Faelindral)</b> <span class=\"sc-tag sc-rec\">Recommended</span> <span class=\"dim\">lvl 1</span></summary><p class=\"sc-why\"><span class=\"badge strat\">strategy</span> Novice Claws of the Keeper (part 1) and Spirit-Blessed Shawl (part 4, level 4), then level 8 steps in Keeper&#x27;s Bight. Ardent Keepers + throughout.</p><table class=\"kv sc-kv\"><tr><th>Giver</th><td>Captain Relgen Greenblade, then Aerin Mossfang</td></tr><tr><th>Where</th><td>Faelindral · Captain Relgen Greenblade at Ranger&#x27;s Rest (hand him your Request for Aid), then Aerin Mossfang in the Quiet Den</td></tr><tr><th>Level</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Classes</th><td>Beastmaster</td></tr><tr><th>Needs first</th><td>none listed</td></tr><tr><th>Faction</th><td>Ardent Keepers (+) and Fellstone Orcs (−) at most steps; Preservers (+) in part 4; Poachers of Calafrey (−) in part 5</td></tr><tr><th>Turn in</th><td>see the steps below (wiki walkthrough)</td></tr><tr><th>Rewards</th><td>Novice Claws of the Keeper (part 1), Spirit-Blessed Shawl (part 4); the zone page also lists Vengeful Claws of the Keeper</td></tr></table><h5>Mobs and items</h5><ul class=\"tight\"><li><b>Diseased Wolf Pelt x4 (part 4)</b>: rabid wolves (4-5)</li><li><b>Blighted Orc Head (part 4)</b>: Vorkuul Blighteye (7), who can spawn when you kill a Fellstone shaman</li><li><b>3 Blood-Soaked Bear Claw, Poacher&#x27;s Arrow, Fledgling Poacher&#x27;s Bow (parts 5-6, level 8)</b>: Keeper&#x27;s Bight; a fledgling poacher conned white at 12</li><li><b>Full Hunt Satchel contents (part 1)</b>: no sourced data yet</li></ul><ol class=\"tight sc-steps\"><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 1 - Req. Lvl 1</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 4 - Req. Lvl 4</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 5 - Req. Lvl 8</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 6 - Req. Lvl ? Was given at Lvl 11 but could be earlier</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li></ol><p><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Eraeldor Lowmist (Shaman guild) cures rabies: target him and /say cleanse me. <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Beastmaster_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">Wiki: Beastmaster Starter Quest (Faelindral) (rev 82724, 2026-10-17)</a></span></p><p class=\"sc-ql\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Beastmaster_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">wiki</a> · <a href=\"/quest-helper.html#q-beastmaster-starter-quest-faelindral\">quest helper</a> · wiki walkthrough updated 2026-09-22</p></details></li><li class=\"sc-step sc-fc\" data-scc=\"druid\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Druid only</span> <span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Class starter quest: <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a href=\"/quest-helper.html\">Wiki quest walkthroughs (quest helper)</a></span><details class=\"sc-q\" id=\"scq-faelindral-s-druid\"><summary><b>Druid Starter Quest (Faelindral)</b> <span class=\"sc-tag sc-rec\">Recommended</span> <span class=\"dim\">lvl 1</span></summary><p class=\"sc-why\"><span class=\"badge strat\">strategy</span> Novice, then Aspirant Icon of the Gatekeeper and Scroll: Minor Frostbite at 1, a Gate trip and Sap-Stained Gloves at 4, and the Icon of the Gatekeeper at 8.</p><table class=\"kv sc-kv\"><tr><th>Giver</th><td>Sylvarya Starveil</td></tr><tr><th>Where</th><td>Faelindral · High Gatekeeper Sylvarya Starveil, Sentinel&#x27;s Gaze (upper tier)</td></tr><tr><th>Level</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Classes</th><td>Druid</td></tr><tr><th>Needs first</th><td>none listed</td></tr><tr><th>Faction</th><td>no sourced data yet</td></tr><tr><th>Turn in</th><td>see the steps below (wiki walkthrough)</td></tr><tr><th>Rewards</th><td>Novice Icon of the Gatekeeper, Scroll: Minor Frostbite and Aspirant Icon of the Gatekeeper (parts 1-2), Sap-Stained Gloves (part 3), Icon of the Gatekeeper (part 4); the Faelindral page also lists Scroll: Burning Embers and Fire Beetle Eye</td></tr></table><h5>Mobs and items</h5><ul class=\"tight\"><li><b>Royal Jelly, Bat Wing, Bone Chips x2 each (part 2)</b>: wasp drones, black bats and rotting skeletons (1)</li><li><b>Broken Shaman Idol x4 (part 3, level 4)</b>: Fellstone shamans (7+)</li><li><b>Wasp Venom Sac, Widow Venom Sac (part 4, level 8)</b>: wasps and Mezzatrian broodlings (10-12, the platform across the broken bridge)</li><li><b>Reekbog Focus (part 4)</b>: Muleda Murktoe (level 13 Druid) after you /pour solution at the moss circle</li></ul><ol class=\"tight sc-steps\"><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 2 - Req. Lvl 1</b></li><li>Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 3 - Req. level 4+</b></li><li>Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 4 - Req. Level 8+</b></li><li>Any spider named Mezzatrian can drop it. They can be found on the platform across the broken bridge. (across the fallen log, up the ramp, behind the waterfall, follow bridges)</li></ol><p><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Part 3 binds you and teleports you to the Sungreet Strand druid ring; Almina Weepingwind gives you the Gate scroll back. <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Druid_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">Wiki: Druid Starter Quest (Faelindral) (rev 80229)</a></span></p><p class=\"sc-ql\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Druid_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">wiki</a> · <a href=\"/quest-helper.html#q-druid-starter-quest-faelindral\">quest helper</a> · wiki walkthrough updated 2026-10-11</p></details></li><li class=\"sc-step sc-fc\" data-scc=\"fighter\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Fighter only</span> <span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Class starter quest: <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a href=\"/quest-helper.html\">Wiki quest walkthroughs (quest helper)</a></span><details class=\"sc-q\" id=\"scq-faelindral-s-fighter\"><summary><b>Fighter Starter Quest (Faelindral)</b> <span class=\"sc-tag sc-rec\">Recommended</span> <span class=\"dim\">lvl 1</span></summary><p class=\"sc-why\"><span class=\"badge strat\">strategy</span> Tarnished Elven Blade and Novice Chain of the Wyrdguard at 1, a Bronzed blade and Striker&#x27;s Chain at 4, and Tempered Blade of the Fae-Bound from part 3 (level 8 may be needed, untested).</p><table class=\"kv sc-kv\"><tr><th>Giver</th><td>Commander Elydris Stormbough</td></tr><tr><th>Where</th><td>Faelindral · Captain Vaelric Ironbark, Sentinel&#x27;s Gaze (hand in the Rolled Leafscroll signed by Commander Elydris Stormbough); Craftguard Vinebrow at the garrison forge</td></tr><tr><th>Level</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Classes</th><td>Fighter</td></tr><tr><th>Needs first</th><td>none listed</td></tr><tr><th>Faction</th><td>Wyrdguard (+); Fellstone Orcs (−)</td></tr><tr><th>Turn in</th><td>see the steps below (wiki walkthrough)</td></tr><tr><th>Rewards</th><td>Tarnished Elven Blade and Novice Chain of the Wyrdguard (part 1), Striker&#x27;s Chain of the Wyrdguard (part 2), Tempered Blade of the Fae-Bound (part 3)</td></tr></table><h5>Mobs and items</h5><ul class=\"tight\"><li><b>Shattered Skull x4 (part 1)</b>: rotting skeletons (1) near the starting lift, or buy them</li><li><b>Fellstone Warrior&#x27;s Belt x4 and Scout Leader&#x27;s Head (part 2, level 4)</b>: Fellstone warriors (5-7) and Scout Leader Krindor (6, on the ridge past the Kennel Lift bridges)</li><li><b>Orc Necromancer&#x27;s Head (part 3)</b>: Taeresh Deathcharmer (13?, Orc Cave)</li><li><b>Copper Bar x4, Cloth Scraps x2, Sylvine x6, Whispering Sage x2</b>: tradeskill materials (sources not listed)</li></ul><ol class=\"tight sc-steps\"><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 1</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li></ol><p><span class=\"badge unc\">unverified</span> The quest-helper walkthrough below is from an older revision (2026-05-26); the wiki page was rewritten on 2026-10-17 (rev 82595), and the summary above follows the new page. <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Fighter_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">Wiki: Fighter Starter Quest (Faelindral) (rev 82595, 2026-10-17)</a></span></p><p class=\"sc-ql\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Fighter_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">wiki</a> · <a href=\"/quest-helper.html#q-fighter-starter-quest-faelindral\">quest helper</a> · wiki walkthrough updated 2026-05-26</p></details></li><li class=\"sc-step sc-fc\" data-scc=\"ranger\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Ranger only</span> <span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Class starter quest: <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a href=\"/quest-helper.html\">Wiki quest walkthroughs (quest helper)</a></span><details class=\"sc-q\" id=\"scq-faelindral-s-ranger\"><summary><b>Ranger Starter Quest (Faelindral)</b> <span class=\"sc-tag sc-rec\">Recommended</span> <span class=\"dim\">lvl 1</span></summary><p class=\"sc-why\"><span class=\"badge strat\">strategy</span> Initiate Keepers Cloak at 1, Verdant Waistguard at 3, and Reach of the Ardent Keeper at 8.</p><table class=\"kv sc-kv\"><tr><th>Giver</th><td>Captain Relgen Greenblade</td></tr><tr><th>Where</th><td>Faelindral · Captain Relgen Greenblade, Ranger&#x27;s Rest</td></tr><tr><th>Level</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Classes</th><td>Ranger</td></tr><tr><th>Needs first</th><td>none listed</td></tr><tr><th>Faction</th><td>Ardent Keepers (+); Fellstone Orcs (−)</td></tr><tr><th>Turn in</th><td>see the steps below (wiki walkthrough)</td></tr><tr><th>Rewards</th><td>Reach of the Ardent Keeper;Initiate Keepers Cloak;(exp)</td></tr></table><h5>Mobs and items</h5><ul class=\"tight\"><li><b>Unintelligible Report (part 4, level 8; one is enough)</b>: Fellstone trackers (8-10)</li><li><b>Part 4 boss</b>: a mob that cons red to a level 8 Ranger (estimated 11), immune to snare; the wiki does not name it</li></ul><ol class=\"tight sc-steps\"><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 1 - Req. Lvl 1</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li></ol><p><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Researcher Fairgrove translates the report (Partially Translated Report, also the reward from Decipher the Unintelligible Writings). <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranger_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">Wiki: Ranger Starter Quest (Faelindral) (rev 75338)</a>, <a href=\"/quest-helper.html\">Wiki quest walkthroughs (quest helper)</a></span></p><p class=\"sc-ql\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranger_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">wiki</a> · <a href=\"/quest-helper.html#q-ranger-starter-quest-faelindral\">quest helper</a> · wiki walkthrough updated 2026-10-02</p></details></li><li class=\"sc-step sc-fc\" data-scc=\"rogue\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Rogue only</span> <span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Class starter quest: <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a href=\"/quest-helper.html\">Wiki quest walkthroughs (quest helper)</a></span><details class=\"sc-q\" id=\"scq-faelindral-s-rogue\"><summary><b>Rogue Starter Quest (Faelindral)</b> <span class=\"sc-tag sc-rec\">Recommended</span> <span class=\"dim\">lvl 1</span></summary><p class=\"sc-why\"><span class=\"badge strat\">strategy</span> Lambent Prospect Dagger at 1, Lambent Prospect Blade and Mask of the Forest Walker at 4, and Lambent Stiletto at 10+.</p><table class=\"kv sc-kv\"><tr><th>Giver</th><td>Elyndiir Nightshade</td></tr><tr><th>Where</th><td>Faelindral · Elyndiir Nightshade, Lambent Lantern Inn (behind the bank)</td></tr><tr><th>Level</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Classes</th><td>Rogue</td></tr><tr><th>Needs first</th><td>none listed</td></tr><tr><th>Faction</th><td>Lambent Wanderers (+) at most steps; Preservers (−) once in part 1; Naelira&#x27;s Court (−) in part 3; part 2d choices move Citizens of Faelindral and the fae courts</td></tr><tr><th>Turn in</th><td>see the steps below (wiki walkthrough)</td></tr><tr><th>Rewards</th><td>Lambent Prospect Dagger (part 1), Lambent Prospect Blade (part 2), Mask of the Forest Walker (part 3), Lambent Stiletto (part 4)</td></tr></table><h5>Mobs and items</h5><ul class=\"tight\"><li><b>Alpha Wolf Fang (part 3, level 4)</b>: a beguiled alpha wolf (8-10), a rare spawn from beguiled wolves in the west wolf den; rare drop</li><li><b>Copy of a Merchant&#x27;s Ledger (part 4, 10+)</b>: /open trunk by the sleeping emissary at the Keeper&#x27;s Bight inn at night (gone at 6am)</li><li><b>Part 4c</b>: the emissary (15) and two higher-level guards, walking from the Keeper&#x27;s Bight treehouse to the Evershade Weald zone line around 7am</li></ul><ol class=\"tight sc-steps\"><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Reward</b></li><li>Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 1 - Req. Lvl 1</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 1a - Find ingredients</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 1b - Ewww!</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 1c - Finishing up</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 2d - Murder she wrote?</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 2e - Finishing up</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 3 - Req. Lvl 4</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 3a - Wolves</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 3b - Finishing up</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 4b - Reporting In</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 4c - The Plan</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li></ol><p><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Part 2d: killing Lilika Thinsticks costs Citizens of Faelindral and Court of Summer faction. <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Rogue_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">Wiki: Rogue Starter Quest (Faelindral) (rev 53204)</a></span></p><p class=\"sc-ql\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Rogue_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">wiki</a> · <a href=\"/quest-helper.html#q-rogue-starter-quest-faelindral\">quest helper</a> · wiki walkthrough updated 2026-08-08</p></details></li><li class=\"sc-step sc-fc\" data-scc=\"shaman\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Shaman only</span> <span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Class starter quest: <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a href=\"/quest-helper.html\">Wiki quest walkthroughs (quest helper)</a></span><details class=\"sc-q\" id=\"scq-faelindral-s-shaman\"><summary><b>Shaman Starter Quest (Faelindral)</b> <span class=\"sc-tag sc-rec\">Recommended</span> <span class=\"dim\">lvl 1</span></summary><p class=\"sc-why\"><span class=\"badge strat\">strategy</span> Novice, then Apprentice Hoop of the Listener at 1, Spirit-Blessed Headdress at 4, and level 8 steps toward the Robes of the Listener.</p><table class=\"kv sc-kv\"><tr><th>Giver</th><td>Varilis Thornvine</td></tr><tr><th>Where</th><td>Faelindral · Varilis Thornvine, the Balanced Branch (read the Folded Leafscroll you start with)</td></tr><tr><th>Level</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Classes</th><td>Shaman</td></tr><tr><th>Needs first</th><td>none listed</td></tr><tr><th>Faction</th><td>Preservers (+); Fellstone Orcs (-); Circle of Spores (+)</td></tr><tr><th>Turn in</th><td>see the steps below (wiki walkthrough)</td></tr><tr><th>Rewards</th><td>(exp); Novice Hoop of the Listener; Apprentice Hoop of the Listener; Spirit-Blessed Headdress; Robes of the Listener; Hoop of the Listener;</td></tr></table><h5>Mobs and items</h5><ul class=\"tight\"><li><b>Bone Chips x4, Shattered Skull x2</b>: rotting skeletons (1), newbie area</li><li><b>Strange Toadstool</b>: a mischievous faerie (2): /throw dust at the wolf den entrance; beware the high-level beguiled wolves</li><li><b>Green Drakeling Scale x5, Wasp Worker Wax x5 (level 4)</b>: green drakelings (4-5) and wasp workers</li><li><b>Selstie Kelp x2, Fine Wood x4, Bight Serpent Skin x4 (part 5, level 8)</b>: Keeper&#x27;s Bight (bight asps ~8-9; wood from lumberjacking), or the tanner</li></ul><ol class=\"tight sc-steps\"><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 1 - Preserve the Balance</b></li><li>Read the Folded Leafscroll that you start with as a new Shaman Character in Faelindral.</li><li>Head to the Shaman Guild (the Balanced Branch, follow signs or review Faelindral map).</li><li>Give Folded Leafscroll to Varilis Thornvine.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Preservers (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Fellstone Orcs (-)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Old Mortar and Pestle from Varilis Thornvine.</li><li>Return to the newbie area and kill a rotting skeleton until you get 4 x Bone Chips and 2 x Shattered Skull. Combine these in the Old Mortar and Pestle.</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You craft Mortar of Bone Dust.</li><li>Return to Varilis Thornvine and give him Mortar of Bone Dust.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Preservers (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Fellstone Orcs (-)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Novice Hoop of the Listener from Varilis Thornvine.</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Pouch of Bone Dust from Varilis Thornvine.</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 2 - The Malicious Faerie</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Note: If you run out of dust and need more...</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Pouch of Bone Dust from Varilis Thornvine.</li><li>Go down the Pixie Lift (Fungi lift) and turn left. Head past the druid ring, fungal ring, cross the bridge, and pass through the ruins.</li><li>Down the hill from the ruins you will spot a cave, which is the aforementioned wolf den.</li><li>Be mindful of a beguiled wolf spawns in the area, as these are high level and aggressive. Invisibility may be useful here.</li><li>Stand in the entrance of the cave and /look to verify you are in the correct location:</li><li>Pick up the dust on your cursor and type /throw dust.</li><li>a mischievous faerie (level 2) will spawn. Kill the faerie and loot Strange Toadstool.</li><li>To avoid agroing the nearby a beguiled wolf spawns, run back towards the ruins as the faerie will eventually path towards them. When the faerie is a safe distance from the cave, engage in combat with it.</li><li class=\"dim\">Note: Upon attacking the faerie..</li><li class=\"dim\">Note: Upon slaying the faerie..</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You loot Strange Toadstool from a mischievous faerie&#x27;s corpse.</li><li>Return to Varilis Thornvine and hand him your Novice Hoop of the Listener as well as the Strange Toadstool.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Preservers (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Fellstone Orcs (-)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Apprentice Hoop of the Listener from Varilis Tornvine.</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 3 - Spore Druids - Req. Level 4</b></li><li>You must be at least level 4 to progress past this part.</li><li class=\"dim\">Note: If you are level 3 or below...</li><li class=\"dim\">Note: If you are level 4 or above..</li><li>Hand Varilis Thornvine your Apprentice Hoop of the Listener.</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Preservers (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Fellstone Orcs (-)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Apprentice Hoop of the Listener from Varilis Thornvine.</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Toadstool Box from Varilis Thornvine.</li><li>Take the Newbie Lift from Faelindral to Evershade Weald and head north. When you reach the river, turn right and follow the northern edge of the river to head into the Spore Caves.</li><li class=\"dim\">Note: THE MYOCID ARE AGGRESSIVE DURING NIGHT HOURS IN-GAME. Use an Invisibility ability if traveling at night.</li><li>Follow the left side of the cave until you climb a ramp. Then, hug the right wall and you will find Sporeweaver Underviel on a raised platform.</li><li class=\"dim\">Note: BEWARE A NUMBER OF SPORELINGS PATH RIGHT PAST THE NPC, DO NOT RISK CONVERSATION WITHOUT INVIS/HIDE HANDY!</li><li>Give Sporeweaver Underviel the Toadstool Box.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Preservers (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Circle of Spores (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Empty Box from Sporeweaver Underveil.</li><li>Loot 5 x Green Drakeling Scale from a green drakeling, and 5 x Wasp Worker Wax from a wasp worker.</li><li>Combine 5 x Green Drakeling Scale and 5 x Wasp Worker Wax in the Empty Box to create the Box of Scales and Wax.</li><li>Give Box of Scales and Wax to Sporeweaver Underveil.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Preservers (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Circle of Spores (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Resealed Toadstool Box from Sporeweaver Underveil.</li><li>Return to Varilis Thornvine and give him Resealed Toadstool Box.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Preservers (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Spirit-Blessed Headdress from Varilis Thornvine.</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 4 -</b></li><li>Hand Varilis your earring while wearing the new headpiece.</li><li class=\"dim\">Note: (At level 4)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive your items back from Varilis Thornvine.</li><li class=\"dim\">Note: (At level 8)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Apprentice Hoop of the Listener from Varilis Thornvine.</li><li>Off we go to the bard guild (Aka the Lambent Lantern)!</li><li>You will find our gal on the first floor in the bard side of the lantern. It&#x27;s up the ramp across from the stage. Hand your hoop to Laenyth Windharp.</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Laenyth&#x27;s Theories from Laenyth Windharp.</li><li>Return to Varilis and hand him the theories.</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive an Empty Water Flask from Varilis Thornvine.</li><li>From the Noob Lift take a right. At the fork in the road take the right side. Run south west until you get to where the river falls off the edge of the map. That&#x27;s the crest of the water fall (the wolf cave is on the cliffs across the river for reference). Stand on the bank just to the right of the rocks (north of them) with your feet in the water.</li><li>You must have either the Ancestor&#x27;s Eye or Ancestral Wisdom buff.</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Part 5 -</b></li><li>Return to Varilis Thornvine and hand him Filled Water Flask</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Sigil of Purging from Varilis Thornvine.</li><li>Go collect 2 Selstie Kelp, 4 Fine Wood, and 4 Bight Serpent Skin. The wood is from Lumberjacking in Keepers Blight. This is also where you will find Bight Asp, which is soloable with your new level 8 spells. Alternatively you can buy it from the tanner in the town there, Tessa Kentwell, if other players have sold some to her for 6cp a piece at the time of this writing.</li></ol><p><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Sporeweaver Underveil is in the Spore Caves (Sporehaven Karst); the myconids are aggressive at night, so bring invisibility if you go then. <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Shaman_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">Wiki: Shaman Starter Quest (Faelindral) (rev 79993)</a></span></p><p class=\"sc-ql\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Shaman_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">wiki</a> · <a href=\"/quest-helper.html#q-shaman-starter-quest-faelindral\">quest helper</a> · wiki walkthrough updated 2026-10-11</p></details></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"archer\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Archer trainer</span> <span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <b>Captain Keyaryn Thornshade</b> (Sentinel&#x27;s Terrace, above the Traders Terrace, in the centre of the giant trunk) The quest page&#x27;s infobox names Commander Elydris Stormbough as the giver, but the walkthrough and the zone table both hand the leafscroll to Keyaryn Thornshade. The walkthrough wins because it is the hand-in step. <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Archer_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">Wiki: Archer Starter Quest (Faelindral) (rev 75499)</a>, <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Faelindral\">Wiki: Faelindral (rev 83070, 2026-10-18)</a></span></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"bard\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Bard trainer</span> <span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <b>Pine Brightreed (starter); Sylphrena Starfall and Laenyth Windharp</b> (Lambent Lantern bard guild (Laenyth up the ramp across from the stage, Sylphrena upstairs). A composer above the Willows Whisper stage sells Bard songs) <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Bard_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">Wiki: Bard Starter Quest (Faelindral) (rev 80008)</a>, <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Shaman_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">Wiki: Shaman Starter Quest (Faelindral) (rev 79993)</a>, <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Faelindral\">Wiki: Faelindral (rev 83070, 2026-10-18)</a></span></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"beastmaster\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Beastmaster trainer</span> <span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <b>Captain Relgen Greenblade, then Aerin Mossfang</b> (Ranger&#x27;s Rest on Keeper&#x27;s Terrace (past the inn toward the kennels), then the Quiet Den kennel. Aerin and Baewyn Mossfang train skills, and a Beastmaster Spell Merchant is in the Quiet Den) <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Beastmaster_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">Wiki: Beastmaster Starter Quest (Faelindral) (rev 82724, 2026-10-17)</a>, <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Faelindral\">Wiki: Faelindral (rev 83070, 2026-10-18)</a></span></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"cleric\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Cleric trainer</span> <span class=\"badge unc\">unverified</span> No Cleric trainer listed on the wiki Faelindral page: no sourced data yet.</li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"druid\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Druid trainer</span> <span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <b>High Gatekeeper Sylvarya Starveil</b> (Sentinel&#x27;s Gaze, the garrison on Sentinel&#x27;s Terrace (upper tier), one platform over from the Fae Lift) No Druid spell vendor is named on the Faelindral page: no sourced data yet. <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Druid_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">Wiki: Druid Starter Quest (Faelindral) (rev 80229)</a>, <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Faelindral\">Wiki: Faelindral (rev 83070, 2026-10-18)</a></span></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"elementalist\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Elementalist trainer</span> <span class=\"badge unc\">unverified</span> No Elementalist trainer listed on the wiki Faelindral page: no sourced data yet.</li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"enchanter\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Enchanter trainer</span> <span class=\"badge unc\">unverified</span> No Enchanter trainer listed on the wiki Faelindral page: no sourced data yet.</li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"fighter\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Fighter trainer</span> <span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <b>Captain Vaelric Ironbark, then Craftguard Vinebrow</b> (Sentinel&#x27;s Gaze garrison: behind the Willows Whisper stage, up to the Traders Terrace, then the central ramp. Vinebrow is at the garrison forge) No Fighter skill trainer is named separately: no sourced data yet. <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Fighter_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">Wiki: Fighter Starter Quest (Faelindral) (rev 82595, 2026-10-17)</a></span></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"inquisitor\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Inquisitor trainer</span> <span class=\"badge unc\">unverified</span> No Inquisitor trainer listed on the wiki Faelindral page: no sourced data yet.</li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"monk\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Monk trainer</span> <span class=\"badge unc\">unverified</span> No Monk trainer listed on the wiki Faelindral page: no sourced data yet.</li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"necromancer\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Necromancer trainer</span> <span class=\"badge unc\">unverified</span> No Necromancer trainer listed on the wiki Faelindral page: no sourced data yet.</li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"paladin\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Paladin trainer</span> <span class=\"badge unc\">unverified</span> No Paladin trainer listed on the wiki Faelindral page: no sourced data yet.</li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"ranger\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Ranger trainer</span> <span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <b>Captain Relgen Greenblade</b> (Ranger&#x27;s Rest (Ardent Keepers), from the top of the Traveler&#x27;s Lift. The Ranger Spell Merchant is with the Ardent Keepers) <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranger_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">Wiki: Ranger Starter Quest (Faelindral) (rev 75338)</a>, <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Faelindral\">Wiki: Faelindral (rev 83070, 2026-10-18)</a></span></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"rogue\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Rogue trainer</span> <span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <b>Elyndiir Nightshade</b> (Lambent Lantern Inn, behind the bank; Myrielle Softglade is in the weapons and armor shop on the Traders Terrace) No Rogue spell or ability vendor is named on the Faelindral page: no sourced data yet. <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Rogue_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">Wiki: Rogue Starter Quest (Faelindral) (rev 53204)</a></span></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"shadow-knight\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Shadow Knight trainer</span> <span class=\"badge unc\">unverified</span> No Shadow Knight trainer listed on the wiki Faelindral page: no sourced data yet.</li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"shaman\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Shaman trainer</span> <span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <b>Varilis Thornvine</b> (The Balanced Branch (Shaman guild), reached from the Ranger and Beastmaster platform. Moon Dances stands near the Shaman Spell Merchant there) <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Shaman_Starter_Quest_(Faelindral)\">Wiki: Shaman Starter Quest (Faelindral) (rev 79993)</a>, <a href=\"/quest-helper.html\">Wiki quest walkthroughs (quest helper)</a></span></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"spellblade\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Spellblade trainer</span> <span class=\"badge unc\">unverified</span> No Spellblade trainer listed on the wiki Faelindral page: no sourced data yet.</li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"wizard\"><span class=\"sc-who\">Wizard trainer</span> <span class=\"badge unc\">unverified</span> No Wizard trainer listed on the wiki Faelindral page: no sourced data yet.</li><li class=\"sc-step\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Newbie area at the foot of the Traveler&#x27;s Lift (wiki levels): black bats, black wolf pups, rotting skeletons and wasp drones 1; large black bats and black widow hatchlings 2-3; dryad fawns 2-3; shrub bats ~3-4; skeletons, black widows, green drakelings and rabid wolves 4-5; dawn and solstice pixies 5. <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Evershade_Weald\">Wiki: Evershade Weald (rev 83151, 2026-10-18)</a></span></li><li class=\"sc-step\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Wasp Ruins, west along the main walkways: wasp workers, neutral but social (solo 3+, group 1-6). The named Wasp Hive Protector is 3-4. <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Per-Level_Hunting_Guide\">Wiki: Per-Level Hunting Guide (rev 73595, 2026-09-22; marked work in progress)</a>, <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Evershade_Weald\">Wiki: Evershade Weald (rev 83151, 2026-10-18)</a></span></li><li class=\"sc-step\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Fellstone Scout Camp, near a fork in the main paths (spiders mean you are on the right path): 3 scouts, a roamer and one inside a tree, scouts 3-6 (solo 3+, group 1-6). They drop Unintelligible Writings; Scout Grimgaze (4-5) is the named. <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Per-Level_Hunting_Guide\">Wiki: Per-Level Hunting Guide (rev 73595, 2026-09-22; marked work in progress)</a>, <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Evershade_Weald\">Wiki: Evershade Weald (rev 83151, 2026-10-18)</a></span></li><li class=\"sc-step\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Starter armor: <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a href=\"/quest-helper.html\">Wiki quest walkthroughs (quest helper)</a></span><details class=\"sc-q\" id=\"scq-faelindral-drake\"><summary><b>Green Drakeling Scale Armor Quests</b> <span class=\"sc-tag sc-rec\">Recommended</span> <span class=\"dim\">lvl 1</span></summary><p class=\"sc-why\"><span class=\"badge strat\">strategy</span> Four-piece starter armor (coat, cloak, pants, boots) plus Defenders and Citizens of Faelindral faction.</p><table class=\"kv sc-kv\"><tr><th>Giver</th><td>Takalea Scaletender</td></tr><tr><th>Where</th><td>Faelindral · Takalea Scaletender, the tannery</td></tr><tr><th>Level</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Classes</th><td>any</td></tr><tr><th>Needs first</th><td>none listed</td></tr><tr><th>Faction</th><td>Defenders of Faelindral (+); Citizens of Faelindral (+)</td></tr><tr><th>Turn in</th><td>see the steps below (wiki walkthrough)</td></tr><tr><th>Rewards</th><td>Green Drakeling Scale Coat; Green Drakeling Scale Cloak; Green Drakeling Scale Pants; Green Drakeling Scale Boots</td></tr></table><h5>Mobs and items</h5><ul class=\"tight\"><li><b>Green Drakeling Scale, Wing, Hide (coat 6/2/4, cloak 3/2/1, pants 4/2/2, boots 2/1/1)</b>: green drakelings (4-5)</li><li><b>Green Drakeling Poison Duct (coat and pants)</b>: Kyros Emeraldscale (8), across the river west of the Newbie Lift bridge</li></ul><ol class=\"tight sc-steps\"><li>Find Takalea Scaletender, located at the tannery in Faelindral.</li><li class=\"dim\">Note: How do we know to ask about materials here?</li><li class=\"dim\">Note: How do we know to ask about the Poison Ducts here?</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Green Drakeling Scale Coat</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Note: Need dialogue from Takalea here.</li><li>Turn in 6 x Green Drakeling Scale, 2 x Green Drakeling Wing, 4 x Green Drakeling Hide, 1 x Green Drakeling Poison Duct to Takalea Scaletender.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Defenders of Faelindral (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Citizens of Faelindral (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Green Drakeling Scale Coat from Takalea Scaletender.</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Green Drakeling Scale Cloak</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Note: Need dialogue from Takalea here.</li><li>Turn in 3 x Green Drakeling Scale, 2 x Green Drakeling Wing, 1 x Green Drakeling Hide to Takalea Scaletender.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Defenders of Faelindral (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Citizens of Faelindral (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Green Drakeling Scale Cloak from Takalea Scaletender.</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Green Drakeling Scale Pants</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Note: Need dialogue from Takalea here.</li><li>Turn in 4 x Green Drakeling Scale, 2 x Green Drakeling Wing, 2 x Green Drakeling Hide, 1 x Green Drakeling Poison Duct to Takalea Scaletender.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Defenders of Faelindral (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Citizens of Faelindral (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Green Drakeling Scale Pants from Takalea Scaletender.</li><li class=\"sc-qh\"><b>Green Drakeling Scale Boots</b></li><li class=\"dim\">Note: Need dialogue from Takalea here.</li><li>Turn in 2 x Green Drakeling Scale, 1 x Green Drakeling Wing, 1 x Green Drakeling Hide to Takalea Scaletender.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Defenders of Faelindral (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Citizens of Faelindral (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Green Drakeling Scale Boots from Takalea Scaletender.</li></ol><p><span class=\"badge unc\">unverified</span> The wiki marks this quest page as needing more info; missing steps: no sourced data yet.</p><p class=\"sc-ql\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Green_Drakeling_Scale_Armor_Quests\">wiki</a> · <a href=\"/quest-helper.html#q-green-drakeling-scale-armor-quests\">quest helper</a> · wiki walkthrough updated 2026-10-01</p></details></li><li class=\"sc-step\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> City quests from newbie drops: <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a href=\"/quest-helper.html\">Wiki quest walkthroughs (quest helper)</a></span><details class=\"sc-q\" id=\"scq-faelindral-cupcakes\"><summary><b>Mierra&#x27;s Famed Cupcakes</b> <span class=\"sc-tag sc-rec\">Recommended</span> <span class=\"dim\">lvl 1</span></summary><p class=\"sc-why\"><span class=\"badge strat\">strategy</span> Four Jelly Cupcakes and Citizens of Faelindral for 4 Royal Jelly. One cupcake starts A Sweet Treat.</p><table class=\"kv sc-kv\"><tr><th>Giver</th><td>Mierra Willowshade</td></tr><tr><th>Where</th><td>Faelindral · Mierra Willowshade, in the building next to the inn by the Newbie Lift</td></tr><tr><th>Level</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Classes</th><td>any</td></tr><tr><th>Needs first</th><td>none listed</td></tr><tr><th>Faction</th><td>Citizens of Faelindral (+)</td></tr><tr><th>Turn in</th><td>see the steps below (wiki walkthrough)</td></tr><tr><th>Rewards</th><td>Jelly Cupcake, 4; (exp);</td></tr></table><h5>Mobs and items</h5><ul class=\"tight\"><li><b>Royal Jelly x4</b>: wasp drones (1) or wasp workers (Wasp Ruins, solo 3+)</li></ul><ol class=\"tight sc-steps\"><li>Mierra Willowshade is located inside the building adjacent to the Inn next to the Newbie Lift.</li><li>Collect 4 Royal Jelly from a wasp drone or a wasp worker in Evershade Weald, then return to Mierra Willowshade and hand them to her.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Citizens of Faelindral (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Jelly Cupcake from Mierra Willowshade.</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Jelly Cupcake from Mierra Willowshade.</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Jelly Cupcake from Mierra Willowshade.</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Jelly Cupcake from Mierra Willowshade.</li></ol><p class=\"sc-ql\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Mierra%27s_Famed_Cupcakes\">wiki</a> · <a href=\"/quest-helper.html#q-mierras-famed-cupcakes\">quest helper</a> · wiki walkthrough updated 2026-09-27</p></details></li><li class=\"sc-step\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Optional: <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a href=\"/quest-helper.html\">Wiki quest walkthroughs (quest helper)</a></span><details class=\"sc-q\" id=\"scq-faelindral-bones\"><summary><b>Bone Chips for Moon Dances</b> <span class=\"sc-tag sc-opt\">Optional</span> <span class=\"dim\">lvl 1</span></summary><p class=\"sc-why\"><span class=\"badge strat\">strategy</span> Tattered Cloth plus Preservers faction for 5 Bone Chips.</p><table class=\"kv sc-kv\"><tr><th>Giver</th><td>Moon Dances</td></tr><tr><th>Where</th><td>Faelindral · Moon Dances, near the Shaman Spell Merchant in the Balanced Branch</td></tr><tr><th>Level</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Classes</th><td>any</td></tr><tr><th>Needs first</th><td>none listed</td></tr><tr><th>Faction</th><td>Preservers (+)</td></tr><tr><th>Turn in</th><td>see the steps below (wiki walkthrough)</td></tr><tr><th>Rewards</th><td>Tattered Cloth; (exp);</td></tr></table><h5>Mobs and items</h5><ul class=\"tight\"><li><b>Bone Chips x5</b>: rotting skeletons (1) and other skeletons, or vendors</li></ul><ol class=\"tight sc-steps\"><li>Moon Dances is located near the Shaman Spell Merchant at The Balanced Branch, which is only reachable from the Ranger/Beastmaster Platform.</li><li>Find and hunt skeleton mobs such as a rotting skeleton in Evershade Weald. You can often times find Bone Chips on vendors in Faelindral as well.</li><li>Give 5 x Bone Chips to Moon Dances.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Preservers (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Tattered Cloth from Moon Dances.</li></ol><p class=\"sc-ql\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Bone_Chips_for_Moon_Dances\">wiki</a> · <a href=\"/quest-helper.html#q-bone-chips-for-moon-dances\">quest helper</a> · wiki walkthrough updated 2026-10-04</p></details></li><li class=\"sc-step\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Repeatable coin: <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a href=\"/quest-helper.html\">Wiki quest walkthroughs (quest helper)</a></span><details class=\"sc-q\" id=\"scq-faelindral-decipher\"><summary><b>Decipher the Unintelligible Writings</b> <span class=\"sc-tag sc-rec\">Recommended</span> <span class=\"dim\">lvl 1</span></summary><p class=\"sc-why\"><span class=\"badge strat\">strategy</span> Repeatable 25 copper per Unintelligible Writings plus Defenders and Citizens of Faelindral faction. The Partially Translated Report is used in the Ranger starter.</p><table class=\"kv sc-kv\"><tr><th>Giver</th><td>Researcher Fairgrove</td></tr><tr><th>Where</th><td>Faelindral · Researcher Fairgrove, Heartwood Archives (the ramp just outside the bank, round the other side of the tree)</td></tr><tr><th>Level</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Classes</th><td>any</td></tr><tr><th>Needs first</th><td>none listed</td></tr><tr><th>Faction</th><td>Defenders of Faelindral (+); Citizens of Faelindral (+); Fellstone Orcs (-)</td></tr><tr><th>Turn in</th><td>see the steps below (wiki walkthrough)</td></tr><tr><th>Rewards</th><td>Partially Translated Report; (exp); (money:25)</td></tr></table><h5>Mobs and items</h5><ul class=\"tight\"><li><b>Unintelligible Writings (one at a time)</b>: Fellstone scouts (3-6), the Scout Camp</li></ul><ol class=\"tight sc-steps\"><li>Researcher Fairgrove is located slightly above the bank (just a few meters) in the Heartwood Archives. Take the ramp just outside of the bank and use the platform that wraps around the other side of the tree.</li><li>Collect Unintelligible Writings from a Fellstone scout in Evershade Weald, then hand them in one at a time to Researcher Fairgrove.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Defenders of Faelindral (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Citizens of Faelindral (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Fellstone Orcs (-)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive 25 copper from Researcher Fairgrove.</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Partially Translated Report.</li><li class=\"dim\">Note: The Partially Translated Report is used in Ranger Starter Quest (Faelindral).</li></ol><p class=\"sc-ql\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Decipher_the_Unintelligible_Writings\">wiki</a> · <a href=\"/quest-helper.html#q-decipher-the-unintelligible-writings\">quest helper</a> · wiki walkthrough updated 2026-09-27</p></details></li><li class=\"sc-step\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Faction and Tattered Rawhide: <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a href=\"/quest-helper.html\">Wiki quest walkthroughs (quest helper)</a></span><details class=\"sc-q\" id=\"scq-faelindral-cull\"><summary><b>Culling the Fellstone</b> <span class=\"sc-tag sc-rec\">Recommended</span> <span class=\"dim\">lvl 1</span></summary><p class=\"sc-why\"><span class=\"badge strat\">strategy</span> Tattered Rawhide plus Wyrdguard and Ardent Keepers faction for one Left Orc Ear.</p><table class=\"kv sc-kv\"><tr><th>Giver</th><td>Wyrdguard Oakenpine</td></tr><tr><th>Where</th><td>Faelindral · Wyrdguard Oakenpine, across the bridge from the tanner building</td></tr><tr><th>Level</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Classes</th><td>any</td></tr><tr><th>Needs first</th><td>none listed</td></tr><tr><th>Faction</th><td>Wyrdguard (+); Ardent Keepers (+); Fellstone Orcs (-)</td></tr><tr><th>Turn in</th><td>see the steps below (wiki walkthrough)</td></tr><tr><th>Rewards</th><td>Tattered Rawhide; (exp);</td></tr></table><h5>Mobs and items</h5><ul class=\"tight\"><li><b>Left Orc Ear</b>: Fellstone warriors (5-7), necromancers (5-7), guards and trackers</li></ul><ol class=\"tight sc-steps\"><li>Seek out Wyrdguard Oakenpine, who is located across the bridge from the Tanner building in Faelindral.</li><li>You can find Fellstone orcs all over Evershade Weald. The most common early level variant is A Fellstone warrior. Kill several orcs until you have one or more Left Orc Ear.</li><li>Hand in 1 x Left Orc Ear to Wyrdguard Oakenpine.</li><li class=\"dim\">Note: The above sentence is accurate in-game as of 2026-10-01.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Wyrdguard (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Ardent Keepers (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Fellstone Orcs (-)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive Tattered Rawhide from Wyrdguard Oakenpine.</li></ol><p class=\"sc-ql\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Culling_the_Fellstone\">wiki</a> · <a href=\"/quest-helper.html#q-culling-the-fellstone\">quest helper</a> · wiki walkthrough updated 2026-10-02</p></details></li><li class=\"sc-step\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> Optional: <span class=\"sc-src\">Source: <a href=\"/quest-helper.html\">Wiki quest walkthroughs (quest helper)</a></span><details class=\"sc-q\" id=\"scq-faelindral-pelts\"><summary><b>Diseased Wolf Pelts for Baewyn Mossfang</b> <span class=\"sc-tag sc-opt\">Optional</span> <span class=\"dim\">lvl 1</span></summary><p class=\"sc-why\"><span class=\"badge strat\">strategy</span> 75 copper plus Ardent Keepers faction per Diseased Wolf Pelt.</p><table class=\"kv sc-kv\"><tr><th>Giver</th><td>Baewyn Mossfang</td></tr><tr><th>Where</th><td>Faelindral · Baewyn Mossfang, the Beastmaster guild (Quiet Den)</td></tr><tr><th>Level</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Classes</th><td>any</td></tr><tr><th>Needs first</th><td>none listed</td></tr><tr><th>Faction</th><td>Ardent Keepers (+)</td></tr><tr><th>Turn in</th><td>see the steps below (wiki walkthrough)</td></tr><tr><th>Rewards</th><td>(exp); (money:75)</td></tr></table><h5>Mobs and items</h5><ul class=\"tight\"><li><b>Diseased Wolf Pelt</b>: rabid wolves (4-5)</li></ul><ol class=\"tight sc-steps\"><li>Seek out Baewyn Mossfang, located in the Beastmaster&#x27;s guild in Faelindral.</li><li>Locate and kill a rabid wolf in Evershade Weald to obtain Diseased Wolf Pelt.</li><li>Give 1 x Diseased Wolf Pelt to Baewyn Mossfang.</li><li class=\"dim\">Experience</li><li class=\"dim\">Faction: Ardent Keepers (+)</li><li class=\"dim\">Receive: You receive 75 copper from Baewyn Mossfang.</li></ol><p class=\"sc-ql\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <a class=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://monstersandmemories.miraheze.org/wiki/Diseased_Wolf_Pelts_for_Baewyn_Mossfang\">wiki</a> · <a href=\"/quest-helper.html#q-diseased-wolf-pelts-for-baewyn-mossfang\">quest helper</a> · wiki walkthrough updated 2026-09-27</p></details></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"archer\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <span class=\"sc-who\">Archer spells</span> Buy or train each as you reach its level (Captain Keyaryn Thornshade): L1 Point Blank I, Salvage Arrows; L2 Barbed Arrow I; L3 Disengagement; L4 Skirmisher; L5 Illuminating Shot, Quick Shot I. <a href=\"/classref/archer/spells.html\">Full list</a></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"bard\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <span class=\"sc-who\">Bard spells</span> Buy or train each as you reach its level (Pine Brightreed (starter); Sylphrena Starfall and Laenyth Windharp): L1 Beats of Battle, Hymn of the Dead, Throw, Whistling Slash; L2 Screaming Vocalization; L3 Somniferous Serenade; L4 Healing Hymn, Siren&#x27;s Call; L5 Traveler&#x27;s March. <a href=\"/classref/bard/spells.html\">Full list</a></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"beastmaster\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <span class=\"sc-who\">Beastmaster spells</span> Buy or train each as you reach its level (Captain Relgen Greenblade, then Aerin Mossfang): L1 Bestial Bond, Call Companion, Enraging Strike I, Fear Beast, Revive Companion; L2 Predatory Instinct; L3 Kick; L4 Guardian Spirit, Lull Minor Beast, Sooth Companion; L5 Lick Wounds, Savage Strike I. <a href=\"/classref/beastmaster/spells.html\">Full list</a></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"cleric\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <span class=\"sc-who\">Cleric spells</span> Buy or train each as you reach its level (your class trainer): L1 Holy Strike, Lesser Resilience, Minor Heal, Polar Alignment: North, Rebuke; L4 Blessed Barrier, Blessing of Smiting, Cure Disease, Cure Poison, Gate, Hymn of Smiting, Lesser Heal, Prayer of the Faithful I, Rebuke II, Smite the Dead I, Soulbind, Summon Hammer of the Righteous. <a href=\"/classref/cleric/spells.html\">Full list</a></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"druid\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <span class=\"sc-who\">Druid spells</span> Buy or train each as you reach its level (High Gatekeeper Sylvarya Starveil): L1 Blast of Frost, Invisibility versus Beasts, Minor Frostbite, Polar Alignment: North, Spark of Nature, Union of Wood, Woodskin; L4 Blast of Sleet, Camouflage, Cure Poison, Gate, Lull Minor Beasts, See Invisibility, Snare, Soulbind, Touch of Nature. <a href=\"/classref/druid/spells.html\">Full list</a></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"elementalist\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <span class=\"sc-who\">Elementalist spells</span> Buy or train each as you reach its level (your class trainer): L1 Companion Strike, Elemental Flash, Flameburst, Minor Creation: Water, Minor Elemental Spellshield, Polar Alignment: North, Reclaim Essence, Summon Drink, Summon Food, Summon Minor Earth Mallet; L4 Elemental Flash II, Gate, Lesser Elemental Rejuvenation, Minor Creation: Earth, Minor Elemental Fury, See Invisibility, Sense Magic, Soulbind, Summon Cloth Bandage, Summon Minor Fire Staff. <a href=\"/classref/elementalist/spells.html\">Full list</a></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"enchanter\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <span class=\"sc-who\">Enchanter spells</span> Buy or train each as you reach its level (your class trainer): L1 Enchant Copper Bar, Invisibility, Invisibility versus Undead, Mesmerize, Minor Group Sagacity, Minor Illusion, Minor Sagacity, Minor Vertigo, Minor Vespyra&#x27;s Veil, Polar Align: North, Torment; L4 Dispel Magic, Gate, Haste, Illusion: Human, Lesser Charm, Lesser Exhaustion, Lesser Fracture Magic, Lesser Lull, Reclaim Essence, Shadowkin Defender I, Soulbind, Torment II, Unveil. <a href=\"/classref/enchanter/spells.html\">Full list</a></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"fighter\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <span class=\"sc-who\">Fighter spells</span> Buy or train each as you reach its level (Captain Vaelric Ironbark, then Craftguard Vinebrow): L1 Offensive Stance, Rend I; L2 Battle Cry; L3 Charge; L4 Defensive Stance; L5 Unnerving Shout. <a href=\"/classref/fighter/spells.html\">Full list</a></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"inquisitor\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <span class=\"sc-who\">Inquisitor spells</span> Buy or train each as you reach its level (your class trainer): L1 Censuring Strike, Distress, Polar Alignment: North, Taunt; L2 Aura of Resistance; L3 Kick, Minor Spellshield, Reflecting Bash; L4 Arcane Aegis, Spell Ward; L5 Arcane Tyrant, Interdiction. <a href=\"/classref/inquisitor/spells.html\">Full list</a></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"monk\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <span class=\"sc-who\">Monk spells</span> Buy or train each as you reach its level (your class trainer): L1 Mend, Moon Style, Round Kick, Taunt, Throw; L2 Celestial Strike; L3 Jab; L4 Feign Death, Sun Style; L5 Sweeping Kick. <a href=\"/classref/monk/spells.html\">Full list</a></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"necromancer\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <span class=\"sc-who\">Necromancer spells</span> Buy or train each as you reach its level (your class trainer): L1 Life Drain, Locate Corpse, Minor Unliving Shield, Noxious Deluge, Polar Align: North, Reclaim Essence, Summon Skeleton; L4 Gate, Invisibility versus Undead, Lesser Steal Strength, Lull the Dead, Mend the Dead, Soulbind, Swirling Shadows. <a href=\"/classref/necromancer/spells.html\">Full list</a></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"paladin\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <span class=\"sc-who\">Paladin spells</span> Buy or train each as you reach its level (your class trainer): L1 Crusader Strike, Minor Healing Touch, Poison Protection, Taunt; L2 Aura of Courage, Conviction; L3 Cure Disease, Shield Slam; L4 Cudgel of Light, Lesser Healing Touch; L5 Lesser Pacify. <a href=\"/classref/paladin/spells.html\">Full list</a></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"ranger\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <span class=\"sc-who\">Ranger spells</span> Buy or train each as you reach its level (Captain Relgen Greenblade): L1 Opening Strike, Polar Alignment: North, Throw, Warden Stance, Weak Healing Poultice; L2 Finishing Blow; L3 Hamstring Slice; L4 Leading Shot, Lull Minor Beasts, Minor Healing Poultice; L5 Kick, Marksman Stance, Recuperate. <a href=\"/classref/ranger/spells.html\">Full list</a></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"rogue\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <span class=\"sc-who\">Rogue spells</span> Buy or train each as you reach its level (Elyndiir Nightshade): L1 Shoot, Sneak, Stab I, Stealth, Throw; L2 Swift Strikes; L3 Jab; L5 Sprint. <a href=\"/classref/rogue/spells.html\">Full list</a></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"shadow-knight\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <span class=\"sc-who\">Shadow Knight spells</span> Buy or train each as you reach its level (your class trainer): L1 Aura of Vampirism, Locate Corpse, Polar Align: North, Shadow Strike, Taunt, Theft of Vigor; L2 Soulrend, Spirit Break; L3 Faltering Pulse, Kick; L4 Goading Bash; L5 Invisibility versus Undead, Lull the Dead. <a href=\"/classref/shadow-knight/spells.html\">Full list</a></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"shaman\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <span class=\"sc-who\">Shaman spells</span> Buy or train each as you reach its level (Varilis Thornvine): L1 Berserker Spirit, Lesser Ghostly Blight, Minor Spirit Mending, Polar Align: North, Spirit Bane, Tribal Spirit; L4 Ancestral Wisdom, Gate, Lesser Spirit Mending, Malady, Omen of Lethargy, Soulbind, Spirit Bane II, Summon Drink. <a href=\"/shaman/spells.html\">Full list</a></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"spellblade\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <span class=\"sc-who\">Spellblade spells</span> Buy or train each as you reach its level (your class trainer): L1 Arcane Infusion, Arcane Spear I, Infused Slash I, Polar Align: North, Shoot, Throw; L2 Minor Spellshield; L3 Aura of the Arcane; L4 Telekinetic Infusion; L5 Kinetic Ward I. <a href=\"/classref/spellblade/spells.html\">Full list</a></li><li class=\"sc-fc\" data-scc=\"wizard\"><span class=\"badge fact\">fact</span> <span class=\"sc-who\">Wizard spells</span> Buy or train each as you reach its level (your class trainer): L1 Minor Flash of Ice, Minor Spellshield, Polar Alignment: North; L4 Eldritch Ward, Gate, Minor Arcane Volley, Reclaim Magic, Root, Seal of Magic, See Invisibility, Sense Magic, Soulbind. <a href=\"/classref/wizard/spells.html\">Full list</a></li></ul></div></div>";